WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.132
Energy never disappears. It changes form.

2
00:00:01.132 --> 00:00:04.956
Follow 98 joules as a 0.5 kg ball drops 20 m.

3
00:00:04.956 --> 00:00:09.662
At the top it is all potential energy: Ep = mgh = 0.5 × 9.8 × 20 = 98 J.

4
00:00:09.662 --> 00:00:13.191
As it falls, potential energy turns into kinetic energy.

5
00:00:13.191 --> 00:00:16.721
Halfway down: 49 J of each. The total is still 98 J.

6
00:00:16.721 --> 00:00:20.250
Just before it lands, all 98 J is kinetic: Ek = ½mv².

7
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:23.779
So 98 = ½ × 0.5 × v², and v ≈ 19.8 m/s.

8
00:00:23.779 --> 00:00:28.485
Some energy becomes heat and sound on the way. The total is still 98 J.

9
00:00:28.485 --> 00:00:33.221
Name each energy change in order, and show the numbers.

10
00:00:33.191 --> 00:00:38.397
